# On-screen controls on the platform's own layout (COURTYARD_START=road): the joystick walks down at full push while
# the other thumb holds A (a sword swing), then the joystick walks at a light push. Touches go through the same hit
# testing as fingers (InputScript "touch"); used by the phone checks.
100 capture touch_start.png
110 touch 1 stick 0 1
130 touch 2 confirm
180 lift 2
190 lift 1
210 touch 1 stick 0 -0.45
250 lift 1
260 capture touch_end.png
280 quit
